---
/** 页脚猫：会摆尾、会眨眼的 SVG 猫。M4 将接入猫窝养成阶段（随回访次数成长） */
---

<div class="footer-cat" data-footer-cat aria-hidden="true">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 140 120" class="cat">
    <!-- 尾巴（摆动） -->
    <path
      class="tail"
      d="M108 92 Q 130 84 126 58 Q 124 46 114 44"
      fill="none"
      stroke="currentColor"
      stroke-width="9"
      stroke-linecap="round"
    />
    <!-- 身体 -->
    <ellipse cx="70" cy="92" rx="34" ry="24" fill="currentColor" />
    <!-- 前爪 -->
    <ellipse cx="52" cy="112" rx="10" ry="5" fill="currentColor" />
    <ellipse cx="88" cy="112" rx="10" ry="5" fill="currentColor" />
    <!-- 头 -->
    <g transform="translate(58,52)">
      <path class="ear ear-l" d="M-20 -12 L-26 -34 L-6 -22 Z" fill="currentColor" />
      <path class="ear ear-r" d="M20 -12 L26 -34 L6 -22 Z" fill="currentColor" />
      <circle cx="0" cy="0" r="22" fill="currentColor" />
      <!-- 眼睛（眨眼动画） -->
      <g class="eyes">
        <ellipse class="eye" cx="-8" cy="-2" rx="3.4" ry="4.6" fill="#1b1b1f" />
        <ellipse class="eye" cx="8" cy="-2" rx="3.4" ry="4.6" fill="#1b1b1f" />
        <circle cx="-7" cy="-3.5" r="1.1" fill="#fff" />
        <circle cx="9" cy="-3.5" r="1.1" fill="#fff" />
      </g>
      <!-- 腮红 -->
      <ellipse cx="-13" cy="6" rx="3.6" ry="2.2" fill="var(--accent-2)" opacity="0.4" />
      <ellipse cx="13" cy="6" rx="3.6" ry="2.2" fill="var(--accent-2)" opacity="0.4" />
      <!-- 鼻嘴 -->
      <path d="M-2.5 6 Q0 8 2.5 6" fill="none" stroke="#1b1b1f" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" />
      <circle cx="0" cy="3.5" r="1.6" fill="#1b1b1f" />
      <!-- 项圈 + 铃铛 -->
      <path d="M-16 16 Q0 24 16 16" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="3.4" stroke-linecap="round" />
      <circle cx="0" cy="22" r="4" fill="var(--accent-2)" />
      <path d="M-1.2 20.8 L1.2 20.8 M0 20.8 L0 23.4" stroke="#1b1b1f" stroke-width="1" />
    </g>
  </svg>
  <p class="nest-label">
    <span data-nest-stage>猫窝 · 初来乍到</span>
    <span class="visits" data-nest-visits></span>
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .footer-cat {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2px;
  }
  .cat {
    width: 108px;
    color: var(--text);
    opacity: 0.92;
  }
  .tail {
    transform-origin: 108px 92px;
    animation: tail-wag 3.2s var(--ease-water) infinite;
  }
  @keyframes tail-wag {
    0%, 100% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
    30% { transform: rotate(14deg); }
    60% { transform: rotate(-8deg); }
  }
  .eyes {
    animation: blink 4.6s infinite;
    transform-origin: 58px 50px;
  }
  @keyframes blink {
    0%, 94%, 100% { transform: scaleY(1); }
    96.5% { transform: scaleY(0.08); }
  }
  .nest-label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .visits {
    color: var(--accent-2);
  }
</style>

<script>
  import { catnest } from '../scripts/catnest';
  const STAGES = [
    { min: 1, name: '初来乍到' },
    { min: 3, name: '纸箱安家' },
    { min: 5, name: '软垫伺候' },
    { min: 10, name: '抱枕毛线' },
    { min: 20, name: '挂灯挂牌' },
    { min: 40, name: '满级猫窝' },
  ];
  const visits = catnest.countVisit();
  const stage = [...STAGES].reverse().find((s) => visits >= s.min) ?? STAGES[0];
  const el = document.querySelector('[data-nest-stage]');
  const v = document.querySelector('[data-nest-visits]');
  if (el) el.textContent = `猫窝 · ${stage.name}`;
  if (v) v.textContent = `来访 ${visits} 次`;
</script>
